"""md — live GitHub-flavoured Markdown preview.

Usage:
  md <file>

Starts a local server, opens your browser, and re-renders the file
as GitHub Flavoured Markdown with GitHub's styling whenever you save.
Raw HTML in the file is rendered alongside Markdown, and Markdown inside
HTML blocks (for example a heading in a <div>) is rendered too. Click a
link to another page in the same folder to preview it. Press Ctrl+C to stop.
"""

